4914: # The failure rules of one claude turn (the main turn, a denial retry, a format repair, a timeout
4915: # continuation) - the adapter contract of agy and muse plus -Turn (the turn's options: Mode, Thread,
4916: # NewThread, Model, Auth) and the fields ModelResolved and OtherModels:
4917: #   $Pre             a failure the bridge already knows (timeout, could not start) - it wins; a
4918: #                    rejecting rate_limit_event before it makes the class quota (no continuation)
4919: #   init proof       (item 4, item 6; evidence first, whatever the exit code) tools, MCP servers,
4920: #                    permission mode -> class permission; apiKeySource -> class auth
4921: #   exit != 0        failed: claude exit <n> - <result text | stderr>; quota or auth wording -> that
4922: #                    class
4923: #   malformed        class transport; no init event (exit 0) -> class permission (not proven); no
4924: #                    result -> failed (the init's session id is a candidate)
4925: #   the session      init and result must agree; a new thread must come back on the minted id, a
4926: #                    resume (every secondary turn) on its thread, a fork on a NEW uuid (not its
4927: #                    parent) - else class unknown, the id a candidate only
4928: #   is_error / subtype other than success -> failed: claude <subtype> - <text>; class quota (a
4929: #                    rejecting rate_limit_event or the limit wording - D6), auth (its wording),
4930: #                    capability (error_max_turns - D8 -, error_max_structured_output_retries)
4931: #   the model        (D4) the init model must be the pinned one (an alias: an id of its family);
4932: #                    modelUsage's main model must be it too - else class capability; a second key
4933: #                    is recorded (OtherModels) and warned about
4934: #   empty reply      with permission denials: failed, class permission, DeniedEmpty (the denial
4935: #                    retry); otherwise failed: empty reply
4936: #   usable           denials beside the reply (the tools and paths), a warning rate-limit status and
4937: #                    other models become Warnings
